{"id":9655364,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-ras/merge_requests/235","number":235,"state":"open","title":"fix: keep FP32 precision in the MatmulAbftVerify FP16 checksum path","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/235","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/235/issues","body":"## 描述\nFP16 输入的 CE checksum 路径此前使用 half 精度，校验和累积的半精度舍入误差会被 ABFT 门限当作故障。改为与 BF16 相同的 FP32 checksum 方案（`ROWCOMPLETE_BF`），`be_for_aiv` 在 tiling/kernel/doc 中统一为 FLOAT32；同时为 `stdEstARowRatio` 的 `log(K)` 增加 K=1 保护。\n\n## 关联的Issue\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-ras/issues/118\n\n## 测试\n更新了 host tiling UT 的 workspace 期望值；`pre-commit`（clang-format 等）通过。当前环境无 CANN/NPU，未执行设备侧 UT 或端到端验证，合入前需在 910B 上用 FLOAT16、K∈{3,5,65,255} 的无故障输入复测 `bad == 0`。\n\n## 文档更新\n`reliability/matmul_abft_verify/docs/aclnnMatmulAbftVerify.md`、`_en.md`：`be_for_aiv` 类型说明。\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\nCloses #118\n\n## 与 ops-nn 的关系\nops-nn 没有 MatmulAbftVerify 算子，本 PR 为 ops-ras 专有修复；共享构建/文档部分的 ops-nn 对齐见 !233。\n","assignees_number":11,"assignees":[{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880ad5a32fa9627bd89c02f","login":"LiuZonggu","name":"LiuZonggu","avatar_url":"https://cdn-static.gitcode.com/avatars/docs.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/LiuZonggu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822dffae4b985165b4b112b","login":"loov1","name":"loov","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/loov1","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d5